
"smart_sources:2024-12-10 - A Great Seal For A Great State (Conflicted copy Laptop (IdahoPTV) 202607281645).md": {"path":"2024-12-10 - A Great Seal For A Great State (Conflicted copy Laptop (IdahoPTV) 202607281645).md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"hyzna9","at":1785795030159},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1785278798631,"size":4000,"at":1785795030187,"hash":"hyzna9"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,29],"####Emma Edwards Green":[30,40],"####Emma Edwards Green#{1}":[32,40]},"outlinks":[{"title":"By Randy Thaemert","target":"By Randy Thaemert","line":5},{"title":"Idaho","target":"Idaho","line":10},{"title":"Emma Edwards Green","target":"https://idaho-forged.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/43986ff9-b612-48b6-97b7-39a0ed38e01c_1920x1080.jpeg","line":28,"embedded":true},{"title":"National Women’s Hall of Fame","target":"https://www.womenofthehall.org/","line":38}],"metadata":{"title":"A Great Seal For A Great State","source":"https://idaho-forged.com/idahos-state-seal/","author":["[[By Randy Thaemert]]"],"published":"2024-12-10","created":"2026-07-24","description":"The State Seal of Idaho was adopted on March 14, 1891, shortly after Idaho became a state on July 3, 1890. The seal was designed by prominent artist and suffragette, Emma Edwards Green.The design of the seal features a miner and a woman, representing Idaho's mining and agriculture industries, respectively. The miner…","tags":["#idaho"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},